<h1 class="doc-h1">Image Crop</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">Cropper.js lets you drag and resize the selection. Apply dispatches <code>image-crop:apply</code> with a PNG data URL in <code>event.detail.dataUrl</code>; reset restores the selection.</p>
